  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NZ-PNG Climate Action Partnership Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NZ&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2018;PNG Climate Action Partnership investigated a programmatic approach to NZ&apos;s climate investments. Design work and business casing identified activities ready for investment by the end of 2025 to meet both NZ and PNG priorities. This was completed through in country design missions, working collaboratively with the CCDA, and completing a strategic investment framework.</narrative>
  </description>
